627
00:31:33,520 --> 00:31:36,720
So, any data related to Exercise Control

628
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:37,800
is something I cannot ignore.

629
00:31:38,160 --> 00:31:39,200
So you're saying

630
00:31:39,640 --> 00:31:41,120
Guo Zijian is also

631
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:42,840
just data?

632
00:31:45,760 --> 00:31:47,360
For my research topic,

633
00:31:47,520 --> 00:31:48,120
he is.

634
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,720
Ready!

635
00:32:02,680 --> 00:32:03,680
Go,

636
00:32:03,680 --> 00:32:04,520
Battalion Commander Guo!

637
00:32:04,520 --> 00:32:05,400
Go,

638
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:06,320
Battalion Commander Guo!

639
00:32:06,320 --> 00:32:07,320
Go!

640
00:32:45,760 --> 00:32:50,000
Go, Battalion Commander Jiang!

641
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:52,000
Go, Battalion Commander Guo!

642
00:32:52,120 --> 00:32:56,360
