649
00:34:04,000 --> 00:34:04,920
Battalion Commander Jiang!

650
00:34:04,920 --> 00:34:05,720
Come on!

651
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:06,440
Battalion Commander Jiang!

652
00:34:06,560 --> 00:34:07,280
Come on!

653
00:34:20,560 --> 00:34:22,880
I just tried that obstacle swing twice.

654
00:34:23,040 --> 00:34:24,520
It's a bit slippery on your side.

655
00:34:24,520 --> 00:34:26,440
Be careful when you go up.

656
00:35:18,960 --> 00:35:19,800
He won!

657
00:35:29,480 --> 00:35:30,640
Did you see that? Did you see that?

658
00:35:30,640 --> 00:35:31,640
Battalion Commander Guo won!

659
00:35:31,840 --> 00:35:33,480
That was absolutely spectacular!

660
00:35:34,480 --> 00:35:35,600
Indeed it was.

661
