694
00:36:36,560 --> 00:36:37,640
It does not mean

695
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:40,040
total superiority in combat readiness.

696
00:36:40,600 --> 00:36:41,560
After this competition,

697
00:36:42,120 --> 00:36:43,400
we will immediately dive into

698
00:36:43,680 --> 00:36:45,880
