705
00:36:54,840 --> 00:36:55,880
wins every battle it fights,

706
00:36:56,040 --> 00:36:57,840
and never accepts defeat!

707
00:36:58,720 --> 00:36:59,800
As the saying goes,

708
00:37:00,640 --> 00:37:02,520
"Those united in purpose

709
00:37:03,400 --> 00:37:04,160
