729
00:38:06,000 --> 00:38:07,920
So Guo Zijian's success in the challenge match

730
00:38:07,920 --> 00:38:09,320
makes it even more commendable.

731
00:38:09,760 --> 00:38:10,280
Indeed.

732
00:38:12,360 --> 00:38:14,040
Are you trying to remind me of something, kid?

733
00:38:15,640 --> 00:38:16,280
No.

734
00:38:16,480 --> 00:38:19,000
Last time I tried to reserve Guo Zijian with you,

735
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:20,320
