736
00:38:20,840 --> 00:38:22,520
Well, now he has proven his capabilities.

737
00:38:22,640 --> 00:38:23,080
Look,

738
00:38:23,160 --> 00:38:23,480
this...

739
00:38:23,800 --> 00:38:25,560
What a rare opportunity.

740
00:38:26,160 --> 00:38:27,480
Regarding the arrangement for Guo Zijian,

741
