770
00:39:31,360 --> 00:39:33,120
It is indeed a bit outrageous.

771
00:39:34,600 --> 00:39:35,560
About this,

772
00:39:36,080 --> 00:39:37,520
I've already talked

773
00:39:38,600 --> 00:39:39,920
