795
00:40:22,440 --> 00:40:23,440
A loss is a loss.

796
00:40:23,440 --> 00:40:24,880
Why mention all that?

797
00:40:26,560 --> 00:40:27,960
I think there's a bright side.

798
00:40:28,400 --> 00:40:29,080
This way,

799
00:40:29,280 --> 00:40:31,480
