810
00:40:53,520 --> 00:40:55,000
Will our brigade headquarters go back on its word?

811
00:40:57,480 --> 00:40:59,480
But it's not like you can't tell,

812
00:41:00,080 --> 00:41:01,440
Guo Zijian completely treated the challenge match

813
00:41:01,440 --> 00:41:03,240
