824
00:41:32,960 --> 00:41:33,800
Exactly.

825
00:41:44,040 --> 00:41:44,480
Lao Suo.

826
00:41:45,080 --> 00:41:45,840
Commissar Kang.

827
00:41:46,440 --> 00:41:47,400
