844
00:42:21,480 --> 00:42:22,280
That's right.

845
00:42:23,840 --> 00:42:25,240
I just don't feel confident about it.

846
00:42:27,880 --> 00:42:28,840
There's one thing

847
00:42:29,280 --> 00:42:30,720
I wonder if you've thought about.

848
00:42:31,480 --> 00:42:33,800
Why was Guo Zijian specifically assigned to

849
00:42:33,920 --> 00:42:35,640
